    "tpa_score_new": "<div>Attendance and participation: 20%, individual</div>\n\n<div>Assignment 1: an analysis of brand elements: 10%, group</div>\n\n<div>Assignment 2: a case analysis of social marketing: 35%, group</div>\n\n<div>Assignment 3: a presentation of business competition: 35%, group</div>\n\n<div>Certification examinations and/or reading reports: extra 10%</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>The maximum of the semester grades: 92</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "1. 同學上課時應依老師引導、根據課程需要使用手機，禁止玩遊戲等非課程相關的使用行為。\n2. 同學上課時須遵守課堂秩序，尊重他人上課權益。\n3. 未能到課者請依規定完成請假，缺曠課過多將影響學期成績。\n4. 以上規則適用實體及線上授課。",
